<title>CHINA: Shanghai bourse closed for Thurs-Fri holiday.</title>
<headline>Shanghai bourse closed for Thurs-Fri holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai stock exchange will close on Thursday and Friday for the Labour Day holiday, an exchange statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume next Monday, it said.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, Shanghai's B share index surged 2.08 percent to end at 91.219 points and the A share index rose 1.21 percent to 1,456.503.</p>
